        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-05T23:29:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this scenario, we should not validate increase of the presentation position. In the case of the remote submix, the \"presentation\" event is consumption of the data by the reader. Since there is no reader, the presentation never happens, thus the presentation position never increases.\n\nYou need to make the validation of the position increase to be optional and do not engage it in this case.",
